    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112500" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύκης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦκος</span>) a fish <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>living
				in seaweed,</i> prob. a species of <i>wrasse, Labrus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				567b20
			</span></i>:—the female was <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῡκίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Mnesim.
				4.38
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				567b19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				591b13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				132.8
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Anaxandr.
				41.49
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Numen.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.282a
			</span></i>: but <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				110.12
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i>, distinguishes <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυκίς</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύκης.</span></div>
